WEBVTT

00:01.750 --> 00:04.330
<b>Man, I'm wiped from student council today.</b>

00:04.790 --> 00:07.960
<b>You know who's got college exams next year? This guy.</b>

00:08.420 --> 00:11.130
<b>There's so much I gotta hand over.</b>

00:13.330 --> 00:15.170
<b>Hey, thanks for the support!</b>

00:15.170 --> 00:16.540
<b>Let's see,</b>

00:16.540 --> 00:20.920
<b>"A school where Nox is stuco president
sounds so fun. Lemme transfer."</b>

00:21.250 --> 00:22.210
<b>Right?!</b>

00:22.750 --> 00:25.000
<b>Whoa! Ow-ow-ow-ow-ow!</b>

00:25.000 --> 00:26.080
<b>Aw, jeez.</b>

00:27.330 --> 00:30.250
<b>Oh, whoops. Look at the time.</b>

00:30.580 --> 00:33.000
<b>Gotta get up tomorrow. Maybe I'll call it a night.</b>

00:33.000 --> 00:33.540
<b>Matz:</b>

00:33.000 --> 00:33.540
<b>not yet</b>

00:33.290 --> 00:34.040
<b>Hey!</b>

00:33.540 --> 00:34.250
<b>Dusk:</b>

00:33.540 --> 00:34.250
<b>gonna run away from the champion?</b>

00:34.250 --> 00:34.420
<b>Aka:</b>

00:34.250 --> 00:34.420
<b>GG</b>

00:34.460 --> 00:35.960
<b>You can't just leave now!</b>

00:35.960 --> 00:37.330
<b>Just 100 more kills?</b>

00:38.080 --> 00:40.460
<b>Anyway, goodbye for now, world!</b>

00:55.330 --> 01:00.250
<b>When will I be able to use magic?</b>

01:00.380 --> 01:05.170
<b>I’ve always longed for something special</b>

01:05.460 --> 01:10.330
<b>1, 2, 3, fall in line, B, C, D, eagerly obedient</b>

01:10.460 --> 01:15.920
<b>But I know best, that that’s not me</b>

01:16.790 --> 01:22.500
<b>No one thinks this is ok the way it is</b>

01:22.500 --> 01:25.290
<b>Anxious legs weighing me down</b>

01:26.290 --> 01:29.960
<b>Even you, who I hold so close</b>

01:30.080 --> 01:34.670
<b>Being frustratingly out of reach, what I see is...</b>

01:34.920 --> 01:40.540
<b>A variety of colors, a myriad of brightness</b>

01:40.540 --> 01:45.580
<b>Even if I’ve been fed up countless times -resonating with you-</b>

01:45.790 --> 01:50.540
<b>Breaking through my thoughts that seem to be on a loop</b>

01:50.540 --> 01:55.170
<b>Mayday to these melancholic days, I dance in the air</b>

01:55.170 --> 01:59.830
<b>Taking a bite out of the gloomy sky</b>

02:00.000 --> 02:07.790
<b>There's an unexpected sweetness, amidst the bitter, sour, salty taste</b>

02:10.130 --> 02:16.880
<b>I’m moving towards where the light shines</b>

02:24.000 --> 02:27.790
<b>Saitama Municipal Omiya</b>

02:24.000 --> 02:27.790
<b>Gakuen High School</b>

02:25.290 --> 02:29.790
<b>Episode 3:                 Kiui Watase</b>

02:26.420 --> 02:27.170
<b>'Morning!</b>

02:27.790 --> 02:29.790
<b>Play</b>

02:27.790 --> 02:29.790
<b>A Modern Day</b>

02:27.790 --> 02:29.790
<b>AMA-NO-IWATO</b>

02:29.790 --> 02:31.290
<b>Amaterasu</b>

02:29.790 --> 02:31.290
<b>Cast</b>

02:29.790 --> 02:31.290
<b>Susano</b>

02:29.790 --> 02:31.290
<b>Cast</b>

02:29.790 --> 02:31.290
<b>Tajikarao</b>

02:29.800 --> 02:31.290
<b>Cast</b>

02:29.800 --> 02:31.290
<b>Omoikane</b>

02:29.800 --> 02:31.290
<b>Cast</b>

02:29.920 --> 02:31.210
<b>Come on, any takers?</b>

02:31.290 --> 02:33.420
<b>Omoikane</b>

02:31.290 --> 02:33.420
<b>Cast</b>

02:31.290 --> 02:33.420
<b>Ama-no-Uzume</b>

02:31.290 --> 02:33.420
<b>Weaver Woman A & B:</b>

02:31.290 --> 02:33.420
<b>Cast</b>

02:31.460 --> 02:32.960
<b>The part of Ama-no-Uzume.</b>

02:33.460 --> 02:37.920
<b>It's a pretty sweet role that does
an entertaining dance at the climax!</b>

02:38.330 --> 02:39.920
<b>That's why I don't want to do it.</b>

02:39.920 --> 02:41.040
<b>I know, right?</b>

02:43.210 --> 02:44.080
<b>Okay!</b>

02:50.830 --> 02:51.630
<b>And now,</b>

02:51.830 --> 02:52.460
<b>like this!</b>

02:52.960 --> 02:53.540
<b>Ack!</b>

02:56.080 --> 02:56.710
<b>Like this?</b>

02:59.500 --> 03:00.790
<b>No, no.</b>

03:01.130 --> 03:01.750
<b>Like this!</b>

03:02.460 --> 03:03.130
<b>This?</b>

03:03.330 --> 03:04.290
<b>Yeah!</b>

03:08.170 --> 03:09.630
<b>Hello?</b>

03:10.830 --> 03:12.210
<b>Oh, there she is!</b>

03:12.540 --> 03:15.170
<b>I heard this was going to be a meeting about JELEE,</b>

03:15.170 --> 03:17.630
<b>but you're dancing... No, cleaning?</b>

03:17.830 --> 03:19.580
<b>Well, you see...</b>

03:20.830 --> 03:21.960
<b>Umm...</b>

03:21.960 --> 03:22.380
<b>Huh?!</b>

03:22.670 --> 03:24.080
<b>Mahiru?! No way!</b>

03:24.880 --> 03:27.830
<b>So that's why we're practicing for that while we work.</b>

03:28.080 --> 03:30.960
<b>Apparently, her part does an entertaining dance!</b>

03:31.460 --> 03:34.210
<b>Maybe I shouldn't have volunteered, after all.</b>

03:34.500 --> 03:38.080
<b>Don't say that! The way you're giving something a try...</b>

03:38.380 --> 03:40.880
<b>I really, really love that!</b>

03:43.420 --> 03:45.750
<b>You're so quick to use the word "love."</b>

03:45.750 --> 03:47.380
<b>Sh-she's right!</b>

03:47.380 --> 03:50.040
<b>And you've never said it to me!</b>

03:50.750 --> 03:52.380
<b>Hey, I love you too Mei!</b>

03:55.540 --> 03:57.330
<b>I love you too...</b>

03:57.920 --> 03:59.630
<b>What is up with this?</b>

04:00.040 --> 04:02.170
<b>Wow, that's quite amazing!</b>

04:02.540 --> 04:05.540
<b>Isn't it?! Our Yoru's got skills!</b>

04:05.710 --> 04:08.210
<b>So you really aren't her manager.</b>

04:08.210 --> 04:09.330
<b>You're still on about that?!</b>

04:09.920 --> 04:12.130
<b>But really, isn't everything about it just the best?!</b>

04:12.130 --> 04:12.920
<b>It's so cute!</b>

04:12.920 --> 04:15.460
<b>Right?! Man, it's amazing!</b>

04:15.630 --> 04:18.210
<b>Invincible GIRL</b>

04:15.630 --> 04:17.920
<b>I-it's a token of my feelings!</b>

04:18.420 --> 04:20.960
<b>I wrote this song yesterday in one sitting.</b>

04:21.580 --> 04:25.670
<b>I put music to the lyrics you gave me,
based on how I see you now, Nono-tan.</b>

04:26.830 --> 04:27.830
<b>Can I listen to it?</b>

04:29.830 --> 04:31.380
<b>Invincible GIRL</b>

04:29.830 --> 04:31.380
<b>Music:                     Kimura</b>

04:29.830 --> 04:31.380
<b>Lyrics/Vocals:</b>

04:38.290 --> 04:39.420
<b>You nailed it, Mei!</b>

04:41.460 --> 04:44.790
<b>Okay, then! Now we just have to record the song...</b>

04:44.790 --> 04:45.580
<b>Right!</b>

04:45.790 --> 04:47.580
<b>...and then for the music video we'll use Yoru's drawing-</b>

04:52.630 --> 04:55.250
<b>Don't you want to see her dancing in the video?</b>

04:55.540 --> 04:56.250
<b>Huh?</b>

04:56.880 --> 05:00.170
<b>You and your crazy ideas. Right, Mei?</b>

05:00.330 --> 05:01.540
<b>I would love to see that!</b>

05:01.540 --> 05:03.380
<b>Uh?! She's a yes-man!</b>

05:03.960 --> 05:06.880
<b>But I don't know who could make a video like that...</b>

05:07.540 --> 05:09.170
<b>Actually, I do.</b>

05:08.830 --> 05:21.000
<b>I'll keep singing. Let my colors reach someone, always, always</b>

05:12.630 --> 05:14.630
<b>Some masked girl took over my live street gig</b>

05:13.290 --> 05:14.290
<b>Hey!</b>

05:20.420 --> 05:21.330
<b>Description</b>

05:20.420 --> 05:21.330
<b>Some masked girl took over my live street gig</b>

05:20.420 --> 05:21.330
<b>Likes</b>

05:20.420 --> 05:21.330
<b>Views</b>

05:24.580 --> 05:25.670
<b>It's ridiculously cute.</b>

05:25.670 --> 05:27.000
<b>Isn't it, though?</b>

05:27.000 --> 05:28.290
<b>The cutest.</b>

05:29.750 --> 05:32.250
<b>Hey, there! The name's Nox Ryugasaki.</b>

05:33.880 --> 05:35.670
<b>Wow, a real VTuber!</b>

05:36.000 --> 05:38.130
<b>I-it's a pleasure to meet you!</b>

05:38.710 --> 05:39.670
<b>Same here.</b>

05:39.920 --> 05:41.500
<b>So you're the former pop idol?</b>

05:41.750 --> 05:44.040
<b>Yes! My name is Kano Yamanouchi!</b>

05:44.040 --> 05:46.250
<b>Oh, you can drop the formalities.</b>

05:46.670 --> 05:49.330
<b>I mean, we're probably the same age.</b>

05:49.330 --> 05:52.170
<b>What, really? Okay, got it.</b>

05:52.170 --> 05:55.460
<b>So hey, how do you two know each other?</b>

05:55.750 --> 05:58.000
<b>Well, we're childhood friends.</b>

05:58.420 --> 06:02.830
<b>Yeah, I looked up to Kiui. She was my superhero.</b>

06:03.500 --> 06:05.330
<b>Superhero?</b>

06:06.540 --> 06:08.540
<b>Yo, we get to use this now!</b>

06:11.000 --> 06:15.540
<b>And hey, I heard your name's "Kiui." What a weird name!</b>

06:15.830 --> 06:22.170
<b>You must be jealous! A weird name means
there's only one of me in the world!</b>

06:22.420 --> 06:23.790
<b>Wh-what?</b>

06:24.210 --> 06:27.580
<b>And what might your names be?</b>

06:27.960 --> 06:28.580
<b>Yah!</b>

06:30.130 --> 06:32.540
<b>Don't want to say, hmm? But I can say mine!</b>

06:33.000 --> 06:34.710
<b>Wh-what does it matter?!</b>

06:35.130 --> 06:37.880
<b>You're not supposed to tell
your name to strangers, anyway.</b>

06:38.130 --> 06:40.960
<b>Kiui Watase, Kiui Watase, Kiui Watase!</b>

06:41.380 --> 06:44.000
<b>The name of this world's main event!</b>

06:44.250 --> 06:46.130
<b>Justice shall prevail!</b>

06:46.130 --> 06:47.040
<b>Huh!</b>

06:47.670 --> 06:52.630
<b>And now, she's a VTuber but also
the student council president at Tatekita High.</b>

06:52.960 --> 06:56.830
<b>Tatekita?! The one with the cute school uniform?</b>

06:57.170 --> 06:58.080
<b>Really?</b>

06:58.290 --> 06:58.960
<b>Yes!</b>

06:59.580 --> 07:01.080
<b>I never knew.</b>

07:01.080 --> 07:06.460
<b>Learn Wisdom</b>

07:01.080 --> 07:06.460
<b>at Tatekita High</b>

07:01.580 --> 07:05.250
<b>I think it's more famous for being a major prep school.</b>

07:05.460 --> 07:06.460
<b>Wow!</b>

07:06.790 --> 07:09.380
<b>So? What can a guy do for you?</b>

07:11.170 --> 07:12.080
<b>Well...</b>

07:13.080 --> 07:14.250
<b>Okay, I see.</b>

07:14.250 --> 07:15.920
<b>Wh-what do you think?</b>

07:16.500 --> 07:18.540
<b>That won't be easy, to be honest.</b>

07:18.880 --> 07:20.000
<b>Ah... okay.</b>

07:20.880 --> 07:22.040
<b>But well...</b>

07:22.380 --> 07:23.080
<b>Here.</b>

07:26.630 --> 07:29.920
<b>An AMV like this would be doable with a few drawings.</b>

07:27.500 --> 07:28.710
<b>Lick lick lick lick lick lick!</b>

07:30.080 --> 07:32.670
<b>I guess you'd call it a music video in your case.</b>

07:30.380 --> 07:31.330
<b>Lick lick lick lick lick lick!</b>

07:32.080 --> 07:32.830
<b>Lick lick lick lick lick lick!</b>

07:33.080 --> 07:35.170
<b>Oh, wow! Did you make this yourself?</b>

07:35.380 --> 07:36.460
<b>Well, yeah.</b>

07:36.710 --> 07:39.460
<b>I remixed the music for it too, actually.</b>

07:40.710 --> 07:42.080
<b>Is there anything you CAN'T do?</b>

07:42.290 --> 07:44.040
<b>Heh heh, isn't she amazing?</b>

07:44.040 --> 07:45.540
<b>Why are you bragging about it?</b>

07:46.830 --> 07:50.290
<b>So anyway, I know you're busy and
it might be too much to ask,</b>

07:50.580 --> 07:51.960
<b>but we could really use your help-</b>

07:51.960 --> 07:52.630
<b>Sure.</b>

07:53.960 --> 07:54.670
<b>Huh?</b>

07:55.330 --> 07:55.920
<b>No problem.</b>

07:56.130 --> 07:57.080
<b>Yes!</b>

07:57.540 --> 08:00.630
<b>I'm so glad! This is really huge.</b>

08:01.040 --> 08:02.580
<b>We're counting on you, Kiui!</b>

08:02.790 --> 08:03.880
<b>Thank you so much!</b>

08:07.710 --> 08:09.380
<b>It's a pretty sweet song.</b>

08:09.380 --> 08:11.920
<b>I-isn't it? Do you think a video's feasible?</b>

08:12.330 --> 08:17.210
<b>Can you can send me a few more drawings?
With different expressions and poses?</b>

08:17.500 --> 08:19.210
<b>How many would you need?</b>

08:19.750 --> 08:22.000
<b>Well, for a video this long...</b>

08:23.920 --> 08:26.000
<b>I should be able to work with five or so.</b>

08:26.290 --> 08:27.130
<b>Got it.</b>

08:27.750 --> 08:30.830
<b>For the background... I guess we can use free images.</b>

08:31.080 --> 08:32.330
<b>No, I'll draw them!</b>

08:32.880 --> 08:37.210
<b>But you know, it isn't like you to agree to help.</b>

08:37.460 --> 08:39.130
<b>I know how busy you are.</b>

08:39.750 --> 08:40.580
<b>That’s true.</b>

08:40.920 --> 08:43.420
<b>Views</b>

08:41.630 --> 08:42.880
<b>I was just wondering why.</b>

08:44.380 --> 08:45.670
<b>I just felt like it.</b>

08:46.170 --> 08:47.960
<b>Does it really matter why?</b>

08:51.290 --> 08:54.420
<b>Three... two... one!</b>

08:54.880 --> 08:56.210
<b>Okay, no more answers!</b>

08:56.420 --> 08:58.750
<b>Uh, 82% would've been up all night?!</b>

08:58.750 --> 09:01.750
<b>On a Monday?! Way too many of you are NEETs!</b>

09:02.670 --> 09:03.790
<b>If you're up early on a Monday, you:</b>

09:02.670 --> 09:03.790
<b>A: were up all night. 82.0%</b>

09:02.670 --> 09:03.790
<b>B: woke up early. 18.0%</b>

09:02.790 --> 09:05.960
<b>Anyway, unlike you all, I've got to go to school.</b>

09:03.790 --> 09:04.790
<b>Shutting down</b>

09:05.960 --> 09:07.330
<b>Goodbye for now, world!</b>

09:20.920 --> 09:23.210
<b>I told them I earn enough from my Super Chats.</b>

09:36.580 --> 09:38.040
<b>ATTACK SPEED</b>

09:36.580 --> 09:38.040
<b>ATTACK RESPONSE</b>

09:36.590 --> 09:38.040
<b>ATTACK SKILL</b>

09:38.040 --> 09:40.380
<b>Pay with Sma-Pay</b>

09:38.040 --> 09:40.380
<b>Purchase</b>

09:40.420 --> 09:41.330
<b>Purchase Complete</b>

09:58.750 --> 10:00.580
<b>That's 10,835 yen.</b>

10:01.250 --> 10:02.460
<b>Sma-Pay, please.</b>

10:04.210 --> 10:05.500
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

10:17.250 --> 10:18.170
<b>Why?</b>

10:20.170 --> 10:23.170
<b>I'm back, peeps.</b>

10:23.630 --> 10:26.290
<b>So listen, I got so pissed off at school today.</b>

10:28.380 --> 10:29.630
<b>The usual, please.</b>

10:29.830 --> 10:31.880
<b>Uh, isn't this your second time here?</b>

10:32.250 --> 10:33.130
<b>There we are.</b>

10:33.130 --> 10:34.540
<b>Amazing, Nono-tan!</b>

10:34.540 --> 10:35.750
<b>You're a pro at pleasing fans!</b>

10:36.380 --> 10:39.130
<b>I wonder if Kiui will come to my school fair?</b>

10:39.540 --> 10:41.170
<b>Huh? Why wouldn't she?</b>

10:41.380 --> 10:42.830
<b>Haven't you been friends forever?</b>

10:43.170 --> 10:44.460
<b>Yeah, but...</b>

10:44.750 --> 10:48.000
<b>we actually haven't met up once
since we started high school.</b>

10:48.290 --> 10:50.040
<b>For two whole years, then?</b>

10:50.630 --> 10:53.460
<b>I want to see her, but she's so busy.</b>

10:53.960 --> 10:55.880
<b>Is your play on the second day?</b>

10:55.880 --> 10:56.500
<b>Yeah.</b>

10:56.710 --> 10:59.500
<b>I wish she'd come watch you dance though, Yoru</b>

10:59.500 --> 11:01.170
<b>Hey, no teasing!</b>

11:01.580 --> 11:04.330
<b>But this story... Ama-no-Iwato, was it?</b>

11:04.500 --> 11:07.330
<b>Why does your part do that weird dance?</b>

11:07.710 --> 11:10.380
<b>Umm... Why was it again?</b>

11:11.250 --> 11:17.000
<b>Due to circumstance, the sun goddess Amaterasu
shuts herself in the Ama-no-Iwato cave.</b>

11:17.380 --> 11:19.040
<b>Yeah, that's right!</b>

11:19.250 --> 11:22.170
<b>That means the sun is gone,</b>

11:23.540 --> 11:28.960
<b>so the other gods put on fun music and
weird dancing to try and entice Amaterasu to come out.</b>

11:29.330 --> 11:32.170
<b>And Miss Mahiru's role, Ama-no-Uzume...</b>

11:34.750 --> 11:37.670
<b>She dances while exposing her breasts
and other intimate areas.</b>

11:38.580 --> 11:40.330
<b>This is the part I'm playing...?</b>

11:40.960 --> 11:41.460
<b>Sei</b>

11:41.460 --> 11:41.960
<b>rin</b>

11:41.960 --> 11:42.830
<b>Fair</b>

11:42.580 --> 11:43.580
<b>Welcome!</b>

11:45.210 --> 11:47.580
<b>Seirin Fair</b>

11:49.000 --> 11:50.330
<b>We have a haunted hooouse.</b>

11:49.670 --> 11:52.080
<b>Cooome tooo the haaaaunted house.</b>

11:50.330 --> 11:51.580
<b>Everyone must coooome.</b>

11:51.580 --> 11:52.830
<b>Please cooome.</b>

11:52.130 --> 11:54.170
<b>Haaaunted hooouse.</b>

11:52.460 --> 11:53.580
<b>Cursed</b>

11:52.460 --> 11:53.580
<b>Haunted House</b>

11:53.580 --> 11:56.330
<b>Entrance</b>

11:53.580 --> 11:56.330
<b>Cursed</b>

11:54.380 --> 11:55.290
<b>Two, please!</b>

11:55.630 --> 11:56.330
<b>Sure!</b>

11:56.830 --> 11:59.000
<b>Huh? These uniforms...</b>

11:59.960 --> 12:02.210
<b>Um, are you from Tatekita High?</b>

12:02.420 --> 12:03.420
<b>We are!</b>

12:03.420 --> 12:05.460
<b>Hey, we're second years, too!</b>

12:05.790 --> 12:07.540
<b>Oh, yeah?</b>

12:08.290 --> 12:11.170
<b>Uh... Do you know a girl named Watase?</b>

12:11.790 --> 12:12.710
<b>Watase?</b>

12:13.080 --> 12:16.540
<b>You know, the really energetic girl
who's student council president?</b>

12:17.880 --> 12:20.290
<b>Our president's name is Mizoguchi, though.</b>

12:20.670 --> 12:21.500
<b>Huh?</b>

12:21.960 --> 12:24.670
<b>Hey, doesn't she mean Kiui Watase?</b>

12:25.080 --> 12:27.500
<b>Oh! The one who stopped coming to school.</b>

12:27.830 --> 12:28.670
<b>What?</b>

12:33.880 --> 12:36.540
<b>A group of five of us went to a diner today,</b>

12:36.540 --> 12:38.170
<b>@ Mahiru</b>

12:36.540 --> 12:41.000
<b>and the bill was exactly 7,777 yen!</b>

12:41.290 --> 12:42.670
<b>Isn't that a miracle?</b>

12:43.380 --> 12:46.040
